      "statement": "The repository uses mise for toolchain management, installing task, talhelper, talosctl, kubectl, flux, helmfile, sops, age, yq, kubeconform, cilium-cli, cloudflared, cue, helm, jq, kustomize, gh, python, makejinja, node, and pipx at versions pinned in .mise.toml, while automatically setting essential environment variables (KUBECONFIG, TALOSCONFIG, SOPS_AGE_KEY_FILE).",
