      "statement": "The repository is organized with bootstrap/ for initial Helm charts, kubernetes/apps/ for Flux-managed applications (one Kustomization per namespace), kubernetes/components/ for reusable components, kubernetes/flux/ for Flux cluster/meta Kustomizations, talos/ for Talhelper configuration and generated machine configs, scripts/ for bootstrap utilities, .taskfiles/ for task subcommand definitions, and configuration files (.mise.toml, .sops.yaml, .renovaterc.json5).",
