      "id": "claim_204861d4639b4f489c2e847e242aa907",
      "statement": "The cluster bootstrap process is split into two phases: bootstrap:talos (generates or reuses talsecret.sops.yaml, runs talhelper genconfig, applies machine configs to nodes, bootstraps Talos control plane, exports kubeconfig) followed by bootstrap:apps (installs Cilium, CoreDNS, cert-manager, and Flux via bootstrap-apps.sh script), after which Flux takes over management of kubernetes/apps/.",
