    {
      "id": "claim_58325d5d96f54447b8ba2defacc4c112",
      "statement": "Flux reconciliation is rooted in two Kustomizations in kubernetes/flux/cluster/ks.yaml: `cluster-meta` (path ./kubernetes/flux/meta, GitRepository `flux-system`) and `cluster-apps` (path ./kubernetes/apps), both with SOPS decryption via the `sops-age` secret in flux-system, 1h interval, prune: true, and wait: true; `cluster-apps` additionally depends on `gateway-api-crds` and `external-dns-crds` which install CRDs from their own GitRepository sources before apps reconcile.",
